   "markdown": "# p_a1b2 \u2014 Standard two-person rhythm: Elena commutes, Priya anchors the home\n\nElena leaves for her office around 8:00 on weekdays and returns at 17:30. She takes her laptop, charger, pen, notebook, water bottle, wallet, hat, helmet, bike-lock, backpack, and umbrella with her. Priya stays home all day: a short walk at 8:00\u20139:00, afternoon errands 14:00\u201316:00 (she takes her water bottle and sometimes her book), and guitar practice in the evening. The dog is fed at 7:30 and 18:00; its bowl stays on the kitchen floor. On weekends Elena sleeps in, does errands around noon, and cycles to see friends Saturday afternoon (14:00\u201317:00). Priya takes a late-morning walk Saturday and Sunday (10:00\u201311:00). What sets this hypothesis apart: the entry hook is bare of Elena's cycling gear between 8:00 and 17:30 on weekdays, and the living-room coffee table is empty of her laptop during that same window. What would refute it: laptop_elena sighted at coffee_table_l1 between 9:00 and 16:00 on a weekday, or Elena's helmet at entry_hook_e1 during her work hours.\n\n```json\n{\n \"claims\": [\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's laptop is out of the house on weekday mornings and afternoons\",\n   \"target\": \"laptop_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 9,\n   \"to\": 16\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Priya's guitar is on the bedroom floor in the evening\",\n   \"target\": \"guitar_priya\",\n   \"expect\": \"bedroom_floor_b1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 19,\n   \"to\": 22\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's cycling gear is out of the house Saturday afternoon\",\n   \"target\": \"helmet_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n   \"days\": \"weekend\",\n   \"from\": 14,\n   \"to\": 17\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"The dog bowl is on the kitchen floor at midday\",\n   \"target\": \"dog_bowl_shared\",\n   \"expect\": \"floor_k_k1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 10,\n   \"to\": 14\n  }\n ],\n \"targets\": {\n  \"laptop_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekend\",\n    \"from\": 14,\n    \"to\": 17,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"sometimes\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"charger_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"pen_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"desk_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"notebook_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"desk_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"water_bottle_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"sink_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 7.5,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"wallet_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\"