   "markdown": "# p_0123 \u2014 Thursday evening is Elena's cycling night; she's out 18:30\u201320:30\n\nElena's weekly social cycling happens on Thursday evenings. She leaves at 18:30 and returns at 20:30. During that window, her helmet, bike_lock, and backpack are OUT_OF_HOUSE (or ON_PERSON while she's riding). She is not in the house from 18:30 to 20:30 on Thursdays. On all other days her cycling gear stays at the entry. Her weekday commute (8:00\u201317:30) is standard. Priya is home Thursday evening and has dinner ready. What sets this apart: on Thursday at 19:00, Elena is NOT in the house, and her helmet is NOT at entry_hook_e1. On Wednesday at 19:00, she IS home and the helmet IS at the entry. What would refute it: helmet_elena at entry_hook_e1 on Thursday at 19:00, or Elena sighted in the living room on Thursday at 19:30.\n\n```json\n{\n \"claims\": [\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's helmet is out of the house on Thursday evening\",\n   \"target\": \"helmet_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 18.5,\n   \"to\": 20.5\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's bike lock is out of the house on Thursday evening\",\n   \"target\": \"bike_lock_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 18.5,\n   \"to\": 20.5\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's helmet is at the entry hook on Wednesday evening\",\n   \"target\": \"helmet_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 18,\n   \"to\": 22\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Elena's laptop is on the coffee table Thursday evening after she returns\",\n   \"target\": \"laptop_elena\",\n   \"expect\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 20.5,\n   \"to\": 23\n  }\n ],\n \"targets\": {\n  \"helmet_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 18.5,\n    \"to\": 20.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"bike_lock_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 18.5,\n    \"to\": 20.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"backpack_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 18.5,\n    \"to\": 20.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"sometimes\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"laptop_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"charger_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"water_bottle_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"sink_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    