   "markdown": "# p_6789 \u2014 A very static home: objects barely move all week\n\nThis household is extremely routine and objects stay in their resting positions almost all the time. Mugs stay in the cupboard except briefly in the morning. The laptop stays on the coffee_table (Elena works from the coffee table, not a desk, and takes it to a town office\u2014so it's OUT_OF_HOUSE 8\u201317:30 but otherwise on the coffee table). The guitar NEVER moves from the bedroom floor. The yoga mat NEVER comes out of the wardrobe (Priya does yoga in the bedroom, mat on bedroom_floor, but it's quick and the robot rarely catches it). The iron NEVER comes out. The vacuum NEVER comes out. The only objects that move are: Elena's work items (OUT_OF_HOUSE weekdays 8\u201317:30), mugs (cupboard \u2192 counter \u2192 sink in the morning), and the dog bowl (always on kitchen floor). What sets this apart: the guitar is at bedroom_floor_b1 at 20:00 (not the living room), the iron is at wardrobe_b1 on Sunday at 15:00, and the vacuum is at entry_floor_e1 on Saturday at 11:00. What would refute it: guitar_priya at floor_l_l1 at any time, or iron_shared at bedroom_floor_b1 on a Sunday.\n\n```json\n{\n \"claims\": [\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"The guitar is on the bedroom floor at 8pm on a Saturday\",\n   \"target\": \"guitar_priya\",\n   \"expect\": \"bedroom_floor_b1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekend\",\n   \"from\": 19,\n   \"to\": 22\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"The iron is in the wardrobe on a Sunday afternoon\",\n   \"target\": \"iron_shared\",\n   \"expect\": \"wardrobe_b1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekend\",\n   \"from\": 14,\n   \"to\": 17\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"The vacuum is at the entry floor on a Saturday morning\",\n   \"target\": \"vacuum_cleaner_shared\",\n   \"expect\": \"entry_floor_e1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekend\",\n   \"from\": 9,\n   \"to\": 13\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"The yoga mat is in the wardrobe at 7am on a weekday\",\n   \"target\": \"yoga_mat_priya\",\n   \"expect\": \"wardrobe_b1\",\n   \"days\": \"weekday\",\n   \"from\": 6,\n   \"to\": 9\n  }\n ],\n \"targets\": {\n  \"guitar_priya\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"bedroom_floor_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"iron_shared\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"wardrobe_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"ironing_board_shared\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"bedroom_floor_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"vacuum_cleaner_shared\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_floor_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"yoga_mat_priya\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"wardrobe_b1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"laptop_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"coffee_table_l1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"weekday\",\n    \"from\": 8,\n    \"to\": 17.5,\n    \"at\": \"OUT_OF_HOUSE\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"mug_elena\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"cupboard_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 6.5,\n    \"to\": 9,\n    \"at\": \"counter_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 9,\n    \"to\": 11,\n    \"at\": \"sink_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"sometimes\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"mug_priya\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"cupboard_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 6.5,\n    \"to\": 9,\n    \"at\": \"counter_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"usually\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 9,\n    \"to\": 11,\n    \"at\": \"sink_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"sometimes\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"dog_bowl_shared\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"floor_k_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n```\n"
